spoiler:



















































You can turn any potion into water by #dipping it twice in water.  After the
first #dip, you have a diluted potion.  You may get stuck with a diluted
potion if the fountain dries up.  Potions of water are very useful, as they may
be turned into holy water.  I haven't looked it up in the source, but I assume
that the effects of a diluted potion of blindness/hallucination etc. last
shorter than a non-diluted one.  So if you haven't identified the dangerous
potions, dilute before you drink.

